{"5106000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SSS-FPV", "steam_appid": 5106000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SSS-FPV is an immersive FPV drone simulator built with realistic physics mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a beginner looking to get started or an experienced pilot honing your acro skills, SSS-FPV offers a realistic flight control experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Mode:</strong> Challenging courses designed to push your reaction speed and lap time limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Mode:</strong> Navigate through high-rise buildings and narrow alleyways for high-speed freestyle flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Features fun balloon-popping challenges that test your precision and control.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAN Multiplayer Support:</strong> Supports up to 4 players over LAN connection to race and compete with friends in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Obstacle Building:</strong> Place and customize obstacles anywhere on the map to create your own unique tracks and practice arenas.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SSS-FPV is an immersive FPV drone simulator built with realistic physics mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a beginner looking to get started or an experienced pilot honing your acro skills, SSS-FPV offers a realistic flight control experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap